 "differences": [
  "Two preprint numbers for the online Experiment 2 did not reproduce and are not used as checks: the overall success rate in the adaptation trials (96.8% printed; 96.88% from the rows) and the drop in success on manipulated trials (2.1 points printed; 1.73 from the rows). The deposit has 15 adaptation trials per block where the preprint and the authors' script describe 12, so the paper probably analysed a subset the deposit does not identify.",
  "The deposit's online Experiment 2 file has 15 adaptation and 6 test trials per mini-block (16 blocks, 336 trials); the preprint and the authors' script describe 12 adaptation trials per block. The rows are kept as shared.",
  "The 3 tutorial trials of the online Experiments 3 and 4b are not in the files (trial_orig starts at 3).",
  "The participant counts and success rates were checked against the preprint (the published JEP:General text was not reachable); the paper's other statistics (mixed models, BIC) were not recomputed because they depend on the authors' trial exclusions, which the deposit does not list. Participant ages and sexes are not in the deposit."
 ],
